<title>POLAND: Kredyt Bank revises down H1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Kredyt Bank revises down H1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kredyt Bank SA results for period ending June 30.</p>
<p>	  (Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  H1 1996     H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			16.46  vs  12.65</p>
<p>    net profit				 9.60  vs   6.01</p>
<p>    pre-tax				   16.48  vs  12.65</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Kredyt Bank SA. Earlier the bank reported H1 net profit of 10.74 million zlotys and pre-tax profit of 17.90 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations	64.82  vs  43.18</p>
<p>    loss on financial operations	 0.65  vs   1.28</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.46  vs   0.02</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    17.83  vs   8.81</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    110.11  vs  77.96</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	  72.61  vs  52.91</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    0.52  vs   0.81</p>
<p>    other operating revenues	    11.82  vs   1.73</p>
<p>    other operating costs		  4.94  vs   2.15</p>
<p>    income tax				 6.88  vs   6.63</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00  vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs   0.01</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
